{"id":"vod_sn_37783","vodId":"37783","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"花开伊吕波","name_cn":"花开伊吕波","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a23524a74e5cb0f0d3ef7dbdc680cca0.jpg"},"summary":"16岁的少女松前绪花（伊藤かな恵 配音）是一个自由生活在东京的普通女高中生。一如这座虽则繁华却死板枯燥的大都市，她的生活平淡无味。正处在幻想的年纪，绪花时刻期盼着“突然的夜奔、突然的爱恋、突然的离别”这类事情的发生。某天，她期盼的已久的时刻终于到来。因偶然的机缘，绪花来到了外婆（久保田民絵 配音）经营的温泉旅馆喜翠庄。在这个位于石川县的偏远所在，时光仿佛凝滞了一般，依然保留着大正时代浓浓的古意。绪花以员工的身份留在喜翠庄，终日努力工作，也结识了和她年龄相仿的女孩子以及形色各异的住客。在这里，她似乎找到了新的生活方向……　　本片为P.A.Works公司成立十周年原创纪念作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XDARWBHGZq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yadM0RZe0Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zbEHF19hwQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LKFvBY084v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GKAyaFeY6T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GCuLsjfGfW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q5YeUZnEwQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YhyzqTJq8k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EE60AhUexn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ip5kKVndaT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xgEM8A8ac81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kabFszgnFp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XHn22cV9zt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yzHxipJcUe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第